Make queueItem::operator== const.

QMultiMap::remove() takes its value argument by const reference and compares
it against the stored value, so the comparison operator must be const-
qualified.  Qt >= 6.11.1 compares through a const_iterator and rejects the
non-const version, which breaks the build of src/cachingqueue.cpp.

